{
  "_README": [
    "This file is the whole tour. Adding, removing or reordering scenes and",
    "hotspots here is all that is needed - no JavaScript changes.",
    "",
    "Anything whose value contains 'SAMPLE' is placeholder content you should",
    "replace. Every hotspot below is marked \"_sample\": true, because the",
    "yaw/pitch values were estimated from the panoramas rather than measured.",
    "Open the tour with ?edit=1, click 'Pick position', click the real spot,",
    "and paste the generated JSON over the sample entry.",
    "",
    "yaw   = left/right, radians, 0 = centre of the source image, range -PI..PI",
    "pitch = up/down, radians, 0 = horizon, POSITIVE IS DOWN",
    "fov   = vertical field of view, radians (1.4 rad = about 80 degrees)"
  ],

  "settings": {
    "defaultScene": "scene06",
